        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion D9-0 Oval Floral Rose Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade out of solid brass, this oval rose deadbolt is available in 5 beautiful finishes--each of which highlight the old world floral styling. A grade 2 single cylinder deadbolt, the bolt is thrown and retracted key from the outside and by a thumb turn from the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b>  The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior.</li>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion D9 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1\" Throw Bolt With Interior Roll Pins</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-Duty strike with 3 screws for added security.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass schlage SC1 keyway & 5 pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Meets ANSI 156.5 Grade 2 Criteria.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b>  of the Fusion D9 Oval Floral Rose Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Door Thickness 1-3/8\" and 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
